WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.575
Radio waves, light and X-rays are the same kind of wave, with different frequencies.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.925
Ultraviolet is one of seven kinds of electromagnetic wave.

3
00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:16.834
Radio: long waves, low frequency, low energy.

4
00:00:19.023 --> 00:00:22.548
Gamma: short waves, high frequency, high energy.

5
00:00:23.326 --> 00:00:27.926
All travel equally fast in a vacuum, and light is a narrow band.
